d admits to  personally causing the death  of five of the eight victims a notice  from prosecutors to introduce other acts  evidence claims jake wagner assaulted  controlled chased and threatened to kill  hannah rhoden during their relationship  and put her body where it would never be  found prosecutors make similar claims  against the wagners involving jake's  older brother george  and his ex-wife and their son the  prosecutor wrote that the wagners got  the woman to sign away  almost all of her custody rights under  false pretenses  and then kept the child from her the  murders in april 2016 were shocking  eight members of the rhoden family shot  in the head as they slept in four  locations  when the wagners moved to alaska in 2017  jake wagner married a young woman court  documents say the wagners threatened to  kill the woman and became upset  when jake's daughter started referring  to her as mom  we're fully satisfied that he's gone  eyes wide open into  this agreement he knows he's going to  die in prison  without any judicial release part of the  plea agreement for jake wagner  included taking the death penalty off  the table for his mom his father  and his older brother george george  wagner is expected in pike county court  this week  for a motion hearing for law and crime  daily  i'm angenette levy thanks annette let's  bring pat and tyrion one last time  pat kind of sounds like he might be  trying to save his family but as our  resident true crime analyst what do you  make of this plea deal  and where should we be looking next in  this case  well you know first of all what a  horrible thing that happened in my home  state of  ohio and i it is so hard for me after  all the crime i've covered in 42 years  to imagine wiping out a couple of  families over a  custody battle among that that  was emerging among all of these people i  don't  i'm not convinced it was just custody at  the same time it looks like  you know in his mind um  he wants to save his own l